{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten-year-old Margo exists in the shadow of her vibrant older sister, Janice, a shadow cast by parents who are too busy admiring one child to truly see the other, leaving Margo to navigate a world of quiet yearning and internal suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Quiet Hum of a Lonely Heart is a short kinetic novel that features ~5K words and 34 images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features themes such as:\u00a0Loneliness and isolation within a family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sibling rivalry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-worth and identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nature of parental love and unintentional neglect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding one's voice and inner strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of imagination and quiet observation</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934520/53a9e1f2ad30f983c14e07fe82b9bf7a2388b096.jpg"},{"name":"Quiet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934520/53a9e1f2ad30f983c14e07fe82b9bf7a2388b096.jpg"},{"name":"Caves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934520/53a9e1f2ad30f983c14e07fe82b9bf7a2388b096.jpg"},{"name":"City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934520/53a9e1f2ad30f983c14e07fe82b9bf7a2388b096.jpg"},{"name":"Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934520/53a9e1f2ad30f983c14e07fe82b9bf7a2388b096.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934520?t=1770824675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934520/e1073aae1d3c7437352efcae1db71c4adb8c2102/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770824675","capsule_image":"https://shared